eed debates this year but if we  are having them  i would rather joe biden have the better  convent convention rather  than the worst one and we'll see how  that continues tonight now donald trump  next week is planning to do his at the  white house  it'll have apparently more of a live  feel than the very pre-produced feel  that the dnc had at least on day one my  guess is trump is going to put together  some kind of in-person crowd that would  be my my guess  now with coronavirus you've got to be  safe you can't do a big thing  packing an arena with 20 000 people  would be crazy  my idea for the speeches  for bernie and michelle and biden etc  for those speeches  i would have instead of doing like 30  short segments as they did yesterday  i would have given the keynote people a  little more time  but made it higher energy by putting  together some small  safe mask wearing socially distant  crowds  outdoors i'm not saying bring i'm not  saying do anything  unsafe but i think we could have gotten  more energy without  increasing the risk of coronavirus with  some small outdoor crowds bernie's crowd  in burlington that's fine  uh michelle's in dc or where you know  wherever they're living or at this point  uh showing the importance of mask  wearing  showing the importance of space but it  would have brought a little something a  je ne sais quoi  that was definitely missing yesterday  that would have been my preference  nothing unsafe  uh we will see how night two goes and i  will be streaming starting about 15  minutes before  the start of day two tonight on youtube  twitch and facebook and i hope that you  will join me there
 

